OL,3,GNEWSADuck patrol plea after 'mindless'
OL,4,Acatapult attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers are stepping up patrols on a
OL,7,Fstretch of river after further attacks
OL,8,Fon wildlife.
OL,10,FResidents in Dorchester, Dorset,
OL,11,Freported ducks being attacked with
OL,12,Fcatapults on the River Frome and
OL,13,Fpigeons being targeted in the town
OL,14,Fcentre.
OL,16,FFollowing a spate of similar incidents
OL,17,Fin the spring, Gillian May set up
OL,18,FDorchester Duck Patrol and she is now
OL,19,Fappealing for more people to help.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
