OL,3,GNEWSADuck patrol plea after 'mindless'
OL,4,Acatapult attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FDorset Police thanked members of the
OL,7,Fpublic who had reported concerns,
OL,8,Fsaying officers had been handed "clear
OL,9,Ffootage" of young people believed to be
OL,10,Finvolved.
